==Description==
'''GG''' is a sticker unlocked by simply joining the game. It can also theoretically be bought in the [[Daily Store]] for {{Coins|200}}, though as it is given for free to new players, this is essentially impossible to do.

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases two players, both with grey skin but the one on the left having a blue torso and smiling face and the other with a red torso and speaking face. The red player has a large speech bubble with the red text "''GG''" written in it. Using this sticker creates a cheering and clapping sound effect.

==Trivia==
*"''GG''" is an abbreviation for "''good game''", which is commonly used in multiplayer video games upon ending a match.

